  <item>
    <title>Ep. 109 谷哥爱跑题2025年度汽车颁奖盛典</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/694c6a44d292ff54b17ae66e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">694c6a44d292ff54b17ae66e</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 24 Dec 2025 22:56:21 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>我把2025年发生在我身边的跟汽车相关的记忆深刻的事件，总结成了以下我精心瞎编的奖项：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="96">00:01:36</a> 年度最意外的优质汽车体验奖</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="402">00:06:42</a> 年度最佳电影或电视中关于汽车的呈现奖</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="588">00:09:48</a> 年度最佳汽车网络meme奖</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtebY9gl5-rLNKUT6vNzi0-oWUco.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fh0IGPHcQDjKvR-rqZ3wS8s366Gf.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="737">00:12:17</a> 年度最令人失望却毫不意外的汽车体验奖</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="805">00:13:25</a> 年度最令人愉悦的驾驶体验奖</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="891">00:14:51</a> 年度最佳汽车烂梗奖</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1067">00:17:47</a> 年度最有望拍成高收视率纪录片的汽车事件奖</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1151">00:19:11</a> 年度最令人失望汽车品牌</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1591">00:26:31</a> 年度最重磅汽车新闻事件</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1833">00:30:33</a> 年度最具潜力但表现严重低于预期车型奖</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2035">00:33:55</a> 年度最暖心汽车记忆奖</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2272">00:37:52</a> 年度打脸打得最响奖（年度最糟糕观点奖）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2370">00:39:30</a> 年度最不舍的告别奖</span></p><span></span><p><span>（Music: Radiohead - No Surprises）</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/62fb153420298b975e3538be/liiZ5zw4buhhZkaI2TR4m2UmuA3c.m4a" length="40918216" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:42:07</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlCun5BNfte7l6MMwuQxiqge7U8k.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
